    """Cumulates commercial-external new foreign borrowing into a running cumulative stress output series.

    Builds the cumulative `new_loan_output` path for the five PV-stress instruments by forward-filling each instrument's cumulative gross borrowing across the projection years.

    Args:
        pv_stress_com_output_new_forex_borrowing_gross_usd: Named-axis `data.Series` of per-instrument, per-year gross new foreign borrowing amounts (float, text, or blank) over the COM3, COM4, COM5, Commercial Bank, and Eurobond rows; years before an instrument's first observation are treated as zero when summed.
        input3_old_debt_service: Typed `data.Input3OldDebtService` series bundle supplying the validated `TIME_PERIOD` domain whose axis keys and positions define the cumulative year spans and drive the per-year offsets.

    Returns:
        `data.Series` over the same instrument and time coordinates holding the cumulative gross new foreign borrowing per year, as floats with `str`/`None` passthrough for missing or textual cells.
    """
    data.INPUT3_OLD_DEBT_SERVICE.schema.validate(input3_old_debt_service)
